  "concurrency": [
    "Four independent official-SDK MCP processes: exactly one explicit claimant; invalid token and malformed evidence leave task state unchanged.",
    "Atomic next-and-claim: concurrent processes select distinct ready tasks or return the normal empty result.",
    "Four independent CLI approvals: exactly one task creation and its proposal decision commit together."
  ],
  "documented_differences": [
    "Go MCP next/claim uses two transactions; the port makes selection and claim atomic as TASK-0011 requires.",
    "Proposal dependency validation and insertion share a transaction in the port.",
    "CLR clock/duration precision is 100 ns; positive sub-tick CLI leases round up to one tick. Imported nanosecond timestamps remain intact.",
    "Commit context-scoring integration is deferred to the planned telemetry port."
  ],
